                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "eb866f76-5bb2-4a40-8ba7-c3487e3f6f01",
                        "source_entry_id": "589cac54-6cc4-34c9-a8b5-56ff81b3b650",
                        "source_sense_id": "8d80c131-3fc3-304f-a56a-29a7e97a229c",
                        "target_lang_word": "alchemist",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "alchemist",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1c7052ab-6259-386f-ab02-ddf329f245dc",
                                        "entry_id": "2e38022b-e5b7-3b7c-b6ee-51b13e52cae8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who practices alchemy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "86456ab7-1cb9-4bdd-ac21-cfde9c72b397",
                                                "sense_id": "1c7052ab-6259-386f-ab02-ddf329f245dc",
                                                "text": "[K]nowledge of philtres, aphrodisiacs, and other sexual stimulants spread from the Arabs and the Moors, from Egypt and India into the European herbals, pharmacopeias, and apothecaries’ lore, and, on a more indeterminate level, among alchemists, wizards, and occultists."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "21254feb-cd5a-453c-8a94-8bf8247fcb46",
                                                "sense_id": "1c7052ab-6259-386f-ab02-ddf329f245dc",
                                                "text": "Years later, scientists learned that the sun’s light—visible and invisible—is merely the by-product of a process alchemists had vainly tried to reproduce for centuries—the transmutation of one element into another. That nature accomplishes this before our very eyes, and that it is what creates the solar heat and light that supports all life, was suspected by no one. The revelation came as a complete surprise."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ad03fc30-1411-3a03-aca1-44a8c405f135",
                                        "entry_id": "2e38022b-e5b7-3b7c-b6ee-51b13e52cae8",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who blends material or substances in the nature or supposed nature of alchemy."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "32cccdca-d12e-4e5e-b79a-cefd2688e5e4",
                        "source_entry_id": "589cac54-6cc4-34c9-a8b5-56ff81b3b650",
                        "source_sense_id": "8d80c131-3fc3-304f-a56a-29a7e97a229c",
                        "target_lang_word": "Alchimist",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Alchimist",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "fc2b2763-ce54-345f-902e-457ff70b4047",
                                        "entry_id": "67ee9fc6-0c7b-3253-8063-277494a97a93",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein mittelalterlicher Chemiker"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "590ce2eb-d2c6-4b74-aaa6-5f0ce85d0307",
                                                "sense_id": "fc2b2763-ce54-345f-902e-457ff70b4047",
                                                "text": "„In den Augen der Ägypter ist dieser Mistkäfer ein richtiger Alchimist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "366aa5f8-7832-419b-9bcd-bf756a0d4f0f",
                                                "sense_id": "fc2b2763-ce54-345f-902e-457ff70b4047",
                                                "text": "„Es gibt nur eine Möglichkeit zu lernen“, entgegnete der Alchimist. … „Und das ist durch Handeln. …“ „Warum nennt man Euch Alchimist?“ „Weil ich einer bin.“ „Und was stimmte bei den anderen Alchimisten nicht, die Metall in Gold verwandeln wollten und es nicht schafften?“ „Sie suchten nur nach Gold“, antwortete der Gefährte."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "428fcd00-40d6-4cb3-ab0c-5ba73955a3ae",
                                                "sense_id": "fc2b2763-ce54-345f-902e-457ff70b4047",
                                                "text": "„Im Landhaus traf ich auch einen Alchimisten, der mir Lust machte, mich in Chemie unterweisen zu lassen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "5a3a0182-b462-4a3e-9fb8-02df42fc5d83",
                                                "sense_id": "fc2b2763-ce54-345f-902e-457ff70b4047",
                                                "text": "„In der Zwischenzeit kochte und mischte der Ingenieur mit der Besessenheit eines Alchimisten weiter.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "638edc28-9bcb-461f-9480-a19886db9470",
                        "source_entry_id": "589cac54-6cc4-34c9-a8b5-56ff81b3b650",
                        "source_sense_id": "8d80c131-3fc3-304f-a56a-29a7e97a229c",
                        "target_lang_word": "алхимик",
                        "target_lang_code": "ru",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "алхимик",
                                "target_lang_code": "ru",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "284f84db-4037-354b-bc8f-829e1bafdd6d",
                                        "entry_id": "9f57f15e-34c7-394d-8e00-6b39ba5de27f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "тот, кто занимается алхимией, ищет философский камень"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bdc5e4d5-a6a4-4358-936c-cd73b5509c87",
                                                "sense_id": "284f84db-4037-354b-bc8f-829e1bafdd6d",
                                                "text": "Алхимики, верные своему взгляду, отличали изменяющееся при горении (sulphur), улетучивающееся без изменения (mer-curius) и остающееся неизмененным (sal)."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "5862ce40-03c3-3d51-b241-bce277bfd38e",
                                        "entry_id": "9f57f15e-34c7-394d-8e00-6b39ba5de27f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "разг., шутл. любитель экспериментировать, проводить опыты (обычно по смешению каких-либо веществ, приготовлению новых блюд и т. п.)"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6d8dda34-8ff1-4ce3-b4af-0b4f310c036e",
                                                "sense_id": "5862ce40-03c3-3d51-b241-bce277bfd38e",
                                                "text": "Или на это место мы должны поставить юриста? алхимика финансов (по выражению Дж. Сороса)?"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    }
